  #line-at(90.024pt, 372.89pt, "of 500 mm (length) × 500 mm (width) × 2 mm (thickness) were used in the ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 392.47pt, "experiment. One plate was artificially machined with a through hole of about 10 mm ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 411.91pt, "in diameter to simulate damage, and the other plate was non-damaged to receive ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 431.47pt, "baseline signals. OLYMPUS 5800 pulse signal transmitter, oscilloscope and AE144S ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 450.91pt, "sensor with resonant frequency of 150 kHz are used to form the experimental device, ")
  #line-at(90.024pt, 470.47pt, "as shown in ")
